          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Émulateurs, BIOS et conseils pour %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Enter Big Box": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ouvrir Big Box"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every game in this list already has info": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tous les jeux de cette liste ont déjà des infos"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every system has an emulator": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Chaque système a un émulateur"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Everything emulation-related lives in one folder: BIOS files, saves and save states (per system), RetroArch's cores and settings, and the emulators RomsBox installs. Back it up or copy it to another Mac to take everything with you. Change its location in Settings › General.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tout ce qui touche à l’émulation est dans un seul dossier : fichiers BIOS, sauvegardes et états (par système), cœurs et réglages de RetroArch, et les émulateurs installés par RomsBox. Sauvegardez-le ou copiez-le sur un autre Mac pour tout emporter. Changez son emplacement dans Réglages › Général."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Executable Path": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Chemin de l’exécutable"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Exit": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Quitter"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Exit Big Box": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Quitter Big Box"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Failed to save %@: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "Failed to save %1$@: %2$@"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Échec de l’enregistrement de %@ : %@"
          }
