        }
      }
    },
    "ScreenScraper": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ScreenScraper"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ScreenScraper doesn't support this system yet.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ScreenScraper ne prend pas encore en charge ce système."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ScreenScraper isn't configured yet — add your devID/devPassword in Settings.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ScreenScraper n’est pas encore configuré — ajoutez votre devID/devPassword dans les Réglages."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ScreenScraper rejected the request (bad credentials or quota exceeded): %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ScreenScraper a refusé la requête (identifiants incorrects ou quota dépassé) : %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ScreenScraper's API requires a devID/devPassword issued to registered client software — separate from your personal account. Request one on their developer forum, then paste it in below.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "L’API de ScreenScraper exige un devID/devPassword attribué aux logiciels clients enregistrés — distinct de votre compte personnel. Demandez-en un sur leur forum développeurs, puis collez-le ci-dessous."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Search Games": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Rechercher des jeux"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Select a Topic": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Choisissez un sujet"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Select a game to see its details.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sélectionnez un jeu pour voir ses détails."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Select inserts a coin, Start starts the game.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Select insère une pièce, Start lance la partie."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Select switches the disk side in most games.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Select change de face de disquette dans la plupart des jeux."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Set Up All Systems": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Configurer tous les systèmes"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Set a default emulator for this system in Settings, or choose one from Launch With.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Choisissez un émulateur par défaut pour ce système dans les Réglages, ou choisissez-en un dans « Lancer avec »."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Settings › Controller sets which button confirms: the bottom one (Xbox, PlayStation) or the right one (Nintendo, Switch). It applies to RomsBox, Big Box and RetroArch's menus.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Réglages › Manette choisit le bouton de validation : celui du bas (Xbox, PlayStation) ou celui de droite (Nintendo, Switch). Cela s’applique à RomsBox, Big Box et aux menus de RetroArch."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Show game details": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Afficher les détails du jeu"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Show in Finder": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Afficher dans le Finder"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Six-button fighting games use the four face buttons for light and medium attacks, and L and R for the strongest ones.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les jeux de combat à six boutons utilisent les quatre boutons de face pour les attaques faibles et moyennes, et L et R pour les plus fortes."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Six-button games use the four face buttons plus L and R.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les jeux à six boutons utilisent les quatre boutons de face plus L et R."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Some systems need the console's BIOS. These files are copyrighted, so RomsBox never downloads them: dump them from hardware you own and put them in the Emulation folder's BIOS folder. Each system's page shows which files it needs and whether they're there.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Certains systèmes ont besoin du BIOS de la console. Ces fichiers sont protégés par le droit d’auteur, RomsBox ne les télécharge donc jamais : extrayez-les du matériel que vous possédez et placez-les dans le dossier BIOS du dossier Emulation. La page de chaque système indique les fichiers nécessaires et s’ils sont présents."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sort As": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Trier comme"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sort By": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Trier par"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sort by": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Trier par"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Standalone Emulators": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Émulateurs autonomes"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Standalone app": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Application autonome"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Start games without inserting coins. Applies to Neo Geo games run with FinalBurn Neo.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lancez les parties sans insérer de pièces. S’applique aux jeux Neo Geo lancés avec FinalBurn Neo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stick as D-pad": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Stick comme croix"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Swap A/B and X/Y": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Inverser A/B et X/Y"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Switch systems with LB / RB.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Changez de système avec LB / RB."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "System": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Système"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "System Default": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Langue du système"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Systems": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Systèmes"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Takes effect when RomsBox restarts.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Prend effet au prochain démarrage de RomsBox."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The %@ core isn't installed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le cœur %@ n’est pas installé."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Emulation folder": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le dossier Emulation"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Jaguar's number pad isn't on modern controllers; games that need it map its keys to spare buttons.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le pavé numérique de la Jaguar n’existe pas sur les manettes modernes ; les jeux qui en ont besoin associent ses touches à des boutons libres."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Virtual Boy's second D-pad is on the right stick.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La deuxième croix directionnelle du Virtual Boy est sur le stick droit."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The assigned custom emulator profile no longer exists.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le profil d’émulateur personnalisé attribué n’existe plus."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The core “%@” is no longer installed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le cœur « %@ » n’est plus installé."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The left stick option applies to RetroArch games; Select + Start also quits DuckStation. Games save normally on the way out.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "L’option du stick gauche s’applique aux jeux RetroArch ; Select + Start quitte aussi DuckStation. Les jeux sauvegardent normalement en quittant."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The touch screen follows the mouse; click to touch.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "L’écran tactile suit la souris ; cliquez pour toucher."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "TheGamesDB": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "TheGamesDB"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "TheGamesDB doesn't support this system yet.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "TheGamesDB ne prend pas encore en charge ce système."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "TheGamesDB isn't configured yet — add your API key in Settings.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "TheGamesDB n’est pas encore configuré — ajoutez votre clé d’API dans les Réglages."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "TheGamesDB matches by searching the ROM's title text rather than an exact filename/CRC match like ScreenScraper, so results can be a bit fuzzier — useful as a fallback while you wait on a ScreenScraper devID, or anytime ScreenScraper has no match.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "TheGamesDB recherche d’après le titre de la ROM plutôt qu’une correspondance exacte de nom de fichier/CRC comme ScreenScraper, les résultats peuvent donc être un peu moins précis — pratique en solution de repli en attendant un devID ScreenScraper, ou quand ScreenScraper ne trouve rien."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "TheGamesDB only needs a self-serve API key — create a free account and generate one from your account page, no separate software-registration review needed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "TheGamesDB n’a besoin que d’une clé d’API en libre-service — créez un compte gratuit et générez-la depuis votre page de compte, sans validation préalable du logiciel."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "TheGamesDB rejected the request (bad API key or quota exceeded): %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "TheGamesDB a refusé la requête (clé d’API incorrecte ou quota dépassé) : %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Title": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Titre"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "To always start in Big Box, turn on Open Big Box at launch in Settings › General.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pour toujours démarrer en Big Box, activez Ouvrir Big Box au démarrage dans Réglages › Général."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Top (Y / Triangle)": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Haut (Y / Triangle)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Total Playtime": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Temps de jeu total"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Triforce games run in Dolphin, the GameCube and Wii emulator, which now includes Triforce support. Use .iso, .gcz or .rvz dumps.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les jeux Triforce tournent dans Dolphin, l’émulateur GameCube et Wii, qui prend désormais en charge le Triforce. Utilisez des dumps .iso, .gcz ou .rvz."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Unexpected response from ScreenScraper: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Réponse inattendue de ScreenScraper : %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Unexpected response from TheGamesDB: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Réponse inattendue de TheGamesDB : %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Unfavorite": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Retirer des favoris"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Up to date": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "À jour"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Update": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mettre à jour"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Update All (%lld)": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tout mettre à jour (%lld)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Updating %@…": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mise à jour de %@…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Utiliser"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use .adf disks, or .lha/WHDLoad packs for hard-disk installs.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Utilisez des disquettes .adf, ou des paquets .lha/WHDLoad pour les installations sur disque dur."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use .chd or .cue/.bin dumps. The Neo Geo CD BIOS goes in a neocd folder inside the BIOS folder.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Utilisez des dumps .chd ou .cue/.bin. Le BIOS Neo Geo CD va dans un dossier neocd à l’intérieur du dossier BIOS."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use .iso or .cso dumps. RomsBox also installs PPSSPP's support files (fonts and data) into the BIOS folder.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Utilisez des dumps .iso ou .cso. RomsBox installe aussi les fichiers de PPSSPP (polices et données) dans le dossier BIOS."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use .wua files (Cemu's compressed format), or .wud/.wux disc images.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Utilisez des fichiers .wua (format compressé de Cemu), ou des images disque .wud/.wux."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use System Default": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Utiliser le réglage du système"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use decrypted game dumps (.3ds, .cci or .cxi).": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Utilisez des dumps de jeux déchiffrés (.3ds, .cci ou .cxi)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Used in RomsBox, Big Box and RetroArch's menus.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Utilisé dans RomsBox, Big Box et les menus de RetroArch."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Username": {
